{"contract":"translation_contextual_v2","candidate_identity":"f69a6c668ca2cee014d00494f6cf314a4402d5555d02c0f96872d8763f5c9489","verdicts":[{"revision_key":"e60af1c2ece7b7b6baf02b2309f5472bf2acf4da81e33097ce0c920fee0c81d5","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"译文把 punch（击打）改成了“击退”。固定源码 game/modules/tome/data/damage_types.lua:1652-1655 等处明确先记录击退成功，失败分支才显示“resists the punch”，两者不是同一事件。"},{"revision_key":"e60c06b1d3cbd260393e8ab31fbb64ed809c142782cfa2baa8ee504f87ccd7cc","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"技能名 Hold the Ground 表示坚守阵地，译文“兽族忍耐”改成了种族耐受能力；固定源码 game/modules/tome/data/talents/misc/races.lua:743-770 虽显示其属于兽人种族并提供精神负面效果清除，但没有“兽族”这一名称含义。"},{"revision_key":"e63f84a992887e4615350b1932af602389f9c53f1a33323fd0eec22cb746bc8a","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"e643063dc0d8687f0db0e01762c55b0d0d2003bcb203da2a3533bfb864fbf1f","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"“回复失衡值”给出了恢复/降低含义，但固定源码 game/modules/tome/class/interface/Combat.lua:2082 对该属性调用 incEquilibrium，正值会增加失衡值；原文标签本身也只说暴击时的 Equilibrium，没有“回复”。"},{"revision_key":"e6609a18c100a29f06276c06a393c29ba6aca49e58621b98aa5f0bfe5124fdd1","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"e66d53860d323fe59145c87fbfd046cd371500e0dac3d2d80f6a9457769102f7","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"译文把 Defense 限定为“近身闪避”。固定源码 game/modules/tome/data/talents/misc/npcs.lua:3210-3217 的加成进入 combatDefenseBase，而 game/modules/tome/class/interface/Combat.lua:1277-1294 显示近战 combatDefense 与远程 combatDefenseRanged 都使用该基础值。"},{"revision_key":"e679ee995ad1d3cc7d6735ecf1667974f4fff52ff396ea15ab001156462c55a4","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"e67a8fe84f90497d0b1820eae7f50ee3d7ec863639fe06515b0b99e1d0c53f04","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"关系被改写：原文是将军把自然之力注入盾牌，并用盾牌抵御魔法与疾病；译文成了注入“将军的自然力量”并“驱散”魔法与疾病。固定源码 game/modules/tome/data/general/objects/world-artifacts.lua:2316 及其抗性属性支持前者。"},{"revision_key":"e6a5f4780937d2b884c85e9711316fe7e45d277b6fef5bfa73f1b62aa3904f24","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"damage taken 被泛化为“所承受的苦难”，丢失了受伤这一机制条件。固定源码 game/modules/tome/data/timed_effects/other.lua:1791 及同效果的 do_onTakeHit 明确表明响应的是受到伤害。"},{"revision_key":"e6da6b226beb737dd13af67199dcbc67a1005011d048d936bcacae1e452aed9f","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"e6e55301b89dee55821a8b311c6125f3607fc4de27096984e2ba712db523e8c5","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"译文仅称“边框”，遗漏其战术信息性质。固定源码 game/modules/tome/class/Game.lua:2013-2034 显示该模式同时调用 Map:setViewerFaction；与仅显示血条且清除 viewer faction 的 health 模式有机制区别。"},{"revision_key":"e70622f7b5f74ce35bd24cd6de77e1cc75ee3d7e008c7265c4e84c4c77a76ec9","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"rambling 表示语无伦次地念叨，译文改成了“大声喊”，无依据地改变了伐木工人的言语状态；固定源码 game/modules/tome/data/quests/lumberjack-cursed.lua:23 只有 rambling，没有 shouting。"}]}